# winoracle (Windows 11, Microsoft Basic Render Driver / WARP, SDK 10.0.26100), 2026-09-28.
# x64 output; the x86 build prints the same lines but for the pointer-size comment. Deterministic
# (two runs identical).
# Remaining differences under Vitreo (Apple M4 Pro), each owned or explained:
# - FL* feature 10 members 0-1 (TiledResourcesTier, MinMaxFiltering) and feature 14 members 4-6
#   (TiledResourcesTier, MapOnDefaultTextures, StandardSwizzle), also in "f14 size 36 accepted":
#   the tiled-resource and texture-map passes own them.
# - FL* feature 19 / feature 20 SharedResourceTier 3 vs 1: TIER_2 and TIER_3 are defined by sharing
#   across Direct3D 11 and Direct3D 12 (Learn D3D11_SHARED_RESOURCE_TIER), and the D3D12 frontend
#   opens no shared handle. TIER_3's Direct3D 11 half (R11G11B10_FLOAT NT handles, "share") matches.
# - "MSAA x4 rect": ClearView rectangles on a multisampled view (depth or colour) fail loudly
#   (UNIMPLEMENTED d3d11!ClearView); a whole multisampled depth view clears.
# d3d11_capsmall_probe, pointer size 8
